<title>PHILIPPINES: Security Bank 1996 net 904 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Security Bank 1996 net 904 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Bank Corp made a net income of 904 million pesos in 1996 compared with 502 million pesos in 1995, a bank official said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The bank's earnings for 1996 contained a non-recurring gain of 280 million pesos, net of taxes, from a property transaction, the official said.</p>
<p>The bank said it would release more details of its earnings later in the day.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
